  "solution": {
    "text": "\\(\\begin{aligned} & \\text {Hints: } B=4\\left[\\frac{\\mu_0}{4 \\pi} \\frac{I}{\\left(\\frac{\\mathrm{L}}{2}\\right)}\\left(\\sin 45^{\\circ}+\\sin 45^{\\circ}\\right)\\right] \\\\ & =\\frac{\\mu_{\\mathrm{o}}}{\\pi} \\frac{2 \\mathrm{I}}{\\mathrm{L}} \\cdot \\frac{2}{\\sqrt{2}} ; \\quad B=\\frac{\\mu_{\\mathrm{o}}}{\\pi} \\frac{2 \\sqrt{2} \\mathrm{I}}{\\mathrm{L}}\\end{aligned}\\)\n<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/wbjee/HtIBfzUGg9OrkDtPgUEhvZTXE0Acd6XdqFYwzP-vm5s.original.fullsize.png\"><br>",
